<section class="chapter tone-white">
  <div class="wrap-wide">
    <div class="chapter-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="num">{{ section.settings.kicker }}</div>
        <h2>{{ section.settings.heading }}</h2>
        <div>{{ section.settings.body }}</div>
        {% if section.settings.pullquote != blank %}
          <blockquote class="pull">{{ section.settings.pullquote }}<span class="by">{{ section.settings.pull_by }}</span></blockquote>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="chapter-img">
        {% if section.settings.image != blank %}
          <img src="{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1400 }}" alt="{{ section.settings.image.alt | escape }}">
        {% else %}
          <img src="{{ 'oliver-tennis.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Oliver Hudson">
        {% endif %}
        {% if section.settings.caption != blank %}<span class="cap">{{ section.settings.caption }}</span>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Story chapter",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "kicker", "label": "Kicker (small label)", "default": "The founder — Oliver Hudson" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Tired of the <em>gym-bag pharmacy.</em>" },
    { "type": "richtext", "id": "body", "label": "Body copy", "default": "<p>I'm Oliver — I played tennis for years, and my training bag was ridiculous: a pre-workout, an electrolyte tub, magnesium, a focus supplement, and a tub of creatine. Five products, five price tags, and I still never knew the doses.</p><p>So I built the opposite. One stick that brings together a stim-free pre-workout, real electrolytes, focus and recovery — every milligram printed on the pack, nothing hidden behind a 'proprietary blend.'</p><p>Most electrolyte sticks under-dose the minerals that matter, and most pre-workouts lean on caffeine to fake energy. IONIQ uses 750mg of sodium from mineral-rich Himalayan pink salt, plus 3g of creatine and 3g of citrulline at doses that actually do something — with no caffeine and no sugar.</p><p>That's how IONIQ came to life: the energy, endurance, focus and recovery I wish I'd had on court, in one stick.</p>" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Side image" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "caption", "label": "Image caption", "default": "Oliver Hudson · founder" },
    { "type": "inline_richtext", "id": "pullquote", "label": "Pullquote (optional)", "default": "If it's not what I'd put in my own bottle before a match, it doesn't make it into IONIQ." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "pull_by", "label": "Pullquote attribution", "default": "— Oliver Hudson, founder" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Story chapter" }]
}
{% endschema %}